    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_0d05133d",
      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "father is mapped as a trump supporter",
      "description": "The text 'i don't know son, i'm a trump supporter' is mapped onto the visual entity 'adult_male: father'. The father's role as the explainer in the scene is contrasted with his stated political affiliation, creating an analogical mapping where the father figure is being portrayed as intellectually deficient due to his political identity. This mapping is central to the meme's satirical intent, linking the visual of a father explaining to his child with the textual claim of political affiliation as a proxy for ignorance.",
