      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the father figure as a Trump supporter",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the adult male (father) figure in the image, who is explicitly identified in the text as a 'Trump supporter'. The meme's humor and harmful intent rely on the user identifying with or imagining themselves as the father, projecting their own identity or perception onto the visual material. The text 'i don't know son, i'm a trump supporter' directly links the father's identity to intellectual deficiency, and the user is invited to project themselves into this role, thereby internalizing or endorsing the meme's stereotype.",
